# Standalone emulator base: matbo87's snes9x_3ds (faster Super FX / SA-1 on
# New 3DS than RetroArch's snes9x2005), patched for single-game CIAs.
#
# EMU_NAME        base name (bases/<EMU_NAME>/); also the checkout folder,
#                 which snes9x_3ds's Makefile uses as its TARGET name
# EMU_REPO/REF    source and commit (REF: v2.0)
# EMU_MAKE_ARGS   extra make arguments for the "elf" target
# EMU_ELF         the ELF it builds, relative to the checkout
# EMU_RSF         its makerom settings (uses APP_ROMFS, APP_SYSTEM_MODE...)
# EMU_ROMFS       its own RomFS files (fonts, graphics), copied into each CIA
# EMU_ICON/BANNER default icon and banner images
# APP_SYSTEM_MODE(_EXT)  memory modes its own CIA uses (Makefile's makerom line)
# EMU_PACKAGES    devkitPro portlibs it links (installed in the build container)
# EMU_MENU_NAME   its name in the touch screen message ("…to go to the X menu")
# EMU_BOTTOM_SCREEN   RomFS pictures of the touch screen (comma-separated):
#                 the injector replaces them with its Virtual Console style one
# EMU_TOP_BACKGROUND  RomFS pictures drawn behind the game: replaced with
#                 the project's bezel, flattened on black
EMU_NAME=snes9x_3ds
EMU_REPO=https://github.com/matbo87/snes9x_3ds
EMU_REF=d2ee361f211810b0b137ee81dfa55ab90bfb4e0c
EMU_MAKE_ARGS="OPT_FLAGS=-O3"
EMU_ELF=output/snes9x_3ds.elf
EMU_RSF=resources/app.rsf
EMU_ROMFS=romfs
EMU_ICON=resources/icon.png
EMU_BANNER=resources/banner.png
APP_SYSTEM_MODE=64MB
APP_SYSTEM_MODE_EXT=Legacy
EMU_PACKAGES="3ds-curl 3ds-mbedtls 3ds-libpng 3ds-zlib"
EMU_MENU_NAME=snes9x
EMU_BOTTOM_SCREEN=gfx/background_second_screen_us.png,gfx/background_second_screen_pal.png
EMU_TOP_BACKGROUND=gfx/background_game_screen.png
